<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>TEDxGIIS Youth</title>
    <style>
        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;600;700&family=Merriweather:wght@700;900&display=swap');

        body{
            font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;
            font-weight: 400;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background-color: #000000;
            color: #FFFFFF;
            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
            -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;
        }

        h1{
            font-size:3em;
            font-family: 'helvetica', Arial, sans-serif;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin: 0.2em 0 0.2em;
            line-height: 1.05;
            letter-spacing: -0.02em;
        }
        .head{
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            width: 100vw;
            position: fixed;
            top:0;
            border-radius: 0 0 20px 20px;
            background-color: #00000083;
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
             -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
        }
        #logoh{
            width: 400px;
        }
        .content{
            margin-top: 100px;
            padding-inline:1em;
            height: calc(100vh - 100px);
            box-sizing:border-box;
        }
        
        .h4{
            color:#FF2B06;
        }
        .hoi{
            margin-top: 0;
            line-height: 0;
        }
        
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="head">
        <img src="resources/logo-white.png" alt="TEDxGIIS Youth Logo" id="logoh">
    </div>
    <div class="content">
        <div class="attentiongrab">

        </div>
        <h1 class="hoi"><span class="h4">TEDx</span>GIIS Youth</h1>
        <h4 class="h4">x = independently organized event</h4>
        <p>In the spirit of ideas worth spreading, TED has created a program called TEDx, where x = independently organized event. TEDx is a program of local, self-organized events that bring people together to share a TED-like experience. Our event is called TEDxGIIS Youth held at the Global Indian International School PG-SMART Campus by students.</p>
        <p>At our TEDxGIIS Youth event at GIIS PG-SMART Campus, we aim to inspire and empower the youth to think creatively and contribute positively to society. Live Speakers and TED talks at past events will combine to spark deep discussion and connection in the audience. The TED Conference provides general guidance for the TEDx program, but individual TEDx events, like ours are independently organized under the guidance of the TEDx program.</p>

    </div>

    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2026 TEDxGIIS Youth. All rights reserved.</p>
    </footer>   

</body>
</html>